          "Title": "InfluxDB.Client.WriteApi.WritePoint(InfluxDB.Client.Writes.PointData, string, string)",
          "Kind": "Method",
          "StartLine": 415,
          "EndLine": 426,
          "Code": "        /// \u003Cparam name=\u0022org\u0022\u003Especifies the destination organization for writes. If the org is not specified then is used config from \u003Csee cref=\u0022InfluxDBClientOptions.Org\u0022 /\u003E.\u003C/param\u003E\r\n        public void WritePoint(PointData point, string bucket = null, string org = null)\r\n        {\r\n            if (point == null)\r\n            {\r\n                return;\r\n            }\r\n\r\n            var options = new BatchWriteOptions(bucket ?? _options.Bucket, org ?? _options.Org, point.Precision);\r\n            _subject.OnNext(new BatchWritePoint(options, _options, point));\r\n        }\r\n"
        }
      ]
